<section class="company-overview single-company__section single-company__section--surface section">
    <div class="section__inner">
        <div class="section__body company-overview__section-body">
            <p class="eyebrow eyebrow--mauve">Overview</p>
            <div class="company-overview__body">
                <p>Anthropic is an AI safety and research company. Anthropic builds reliable, interpretative, and steerable AI systems. It translates its frontier research into practical products, such as the Claude family of models, to serve businesses, nonprofits, and other organizations.</p>
            </div>
