<p class="is-style-type-body-xs has-dark-neutral-typography-tertiary-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-41 wp-block-paragraph" style="margin-top:8px;margin-bottom:8px"><br>Any securities are offered by NPM Securities, LLC, member FINRA/SIPC.&nbsp;FINRA BrokerCheck.&nbsp;SecondMarket&nbsp;Financial,&nbsp;LLC&nbsp;is an SEC-registered investment advisor and wholly owned subsidiary of Nasdaq Private Market,&nbsp;LLC.<br></p>



<p class="is-style-type-body-xs has-dark-neutral-typography-tertiary-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-42 wp-block-paragraph" style="margin-top:8px;margin-bottom:8px">California Residents – Do Not Sell or Share My Personal Information<br></p>



<p class="is-style-type-body-xs has-dark-neutral-typography-tertiary-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-43 wp-block-paragraph" style="margin-top:8px;margin-bottom:8px">NASDAQ PRIVATE MARKET and NPM are registered trademarks of Nasdaq, Inc. and are used by Nasdaq Private Market under license.<br></p>



<p class="is-style-type-body-xs has-dark-neutral-typography-tertiary-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-44 wp-block-paragraph" style="margin-top:8px;margin-bottom:8px">Cumulative totals reflect statistics since NPM’s inception and include activity through NPM Securities, LLC and SMTX, LLC, a former affiliated broker-dealer.<br></p>



<p class="is-style-type-body-xs has-dark-neutral-typography-tertiary-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-45 wp-block-paragraph" style="margin-top:8px;margin-bottom:8px">NPM Investor Services are available only to “Accredited Investors” defined by the U.S. Securities and Exchange Commission.<br></p>



<p class="is-style-type-body-xs has-dark-neutral-typography-tertiary-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-46 wp-block-paragraph" style="margin-top:8px;margin-bottom:71px">Nasdaq Private Market, LLC. and its affiliates do not provide tax, legal, investment or accounting advice. This material has been prepared for informational purposes only and is not intended to constitute tax, legal, investment or accounting advice. You should consult your own tax, legal, investment and accounting advisors before making any transaction.</p>
